{"id":"wb-7-705","name":"灵岳寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"灵岳寺","text":"灵岳寺，位于北京市门头沟区斋堂镇灵岳寺村，是一座汉传佛教寺院。\n灵岳寺是北京地区唯一一处保存较完整的元代以前的木结构寺院。该寺对北京西部的佛教发展发挥过重要影响。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E5%B2%B3%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93931474,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93931474","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null}